title: mf task show
tags: [[CLI command]] Tasks
kind: reference
summary: Show a single background task by id (or stop it with --stop)

One task; exit code 1 when the id is unknown. With `--stop` (`--cancel`), stops it
instead ([[Cancelling a task]]): a task already finished, of a kind that cannot be
stopped, or unknown is reported on stderr, exit code 1.
